<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Whisper</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>whisper &lt;someone&gt; &lt;words&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>whisper Gnort Meet me at the fountain.
</pre>
<p>Says something for one person in the room alone. Only they hear your 
words; the others see that you whisper something to them, but not what. 
To speak to someone who isn't here, use <a cmd='#'>Help Tell</a>.
</p><p>If they can't see you, they hear "someone" whisper. If you are drunk, it 
shows in your words.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Say</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Tell</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Ask</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Communications</a>
</pre>




</div>